          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>Ashgut's turn ends and Seawaster was not triggered last turn.</p><hr /><p>Rearing on her hind legs, Ashgut prepares to unleash the full power of her acidic breath on her enemies.</p><p>At the beginning of her next turn, she blasts the arena with acidic saltwater, melting everything touching a surface. She deals @Damage[16d6[acid]] damage with a <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\">@Check[type:fortitude|dc:34|basic:true] save to all creatures and objects in the arena in contact with the ground or a wall. Creatures adjacent to or impaled by one of Fjordcarver's oceanic spikes treat their saving throw as one degree better (this does not stack with Evasion or similar abilities).</span></p>"
