        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Ashgut's internal acidity is so intense, she turns water around her into acidic sludge. Ashgut is immune to effects with the water trait. Additionally, Oceanic Spikes does not target Ashgut.</p>\n<p>Although she is a brine dragon, Ashgut's wings are too damaged to be useful, and she cannot fly as a result. If Ashgut is not touching the ground, swimming, or in contact with a solid surface that is touching the ground (such as a wall while climbing), she is off-guard.</p>"
        },
