        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Ashgut's eyes acidify the mind of a foe. The target takes @Damage[3d8[acid]] damage with a <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\">(@Check[type:will|dc:32|basic:false] save). Regardless of their save, the target is immune to Acidic Stare for 1 round.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary)\"><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}.</span></p>"
